  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "AITextAnalyzerField: new AllowedExtensions setting (\"pdf, jpg, png\"). The file input gets the matching accept attribute and other files are rejected with a message on the field. When a FileField is linked (FileField setting) and that FileField has AllowedExtensions, the FileField's setting is used; when both are empty the file types that the document analysis (Azure Document Intelligence) can read are accepted (pdf, jpg, jpeg, png, bmp, tiff, tif, heif, docx, xlsx, pptx, html).\nBulkFileTransferButtonField: the upload button accepts the file types the target module can read (the extension of the module's CsvFileFormatField, otherwise xlsx / xlsm) and rejects other files with a message, the same as the list page bulk upload.\nRequires Codeer.LowCode.Blazor 1.3.35.",
